"""Contract-test setup: each sample checked against its folder's JSON Schema.

The schemas use a small subset of JSON Schema (type, properties, required, additionalProperties,
items, minItems, minLength, pattern, minimum, maximum, exclusiveMinimum); `schema_errors` checks
